{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The code now rejects unreadable material, incomplete snapshots, and failed tag peels from the caches, and all four caches use a shared helper for concurrent misses. I’m checking the helper’s retry and eviction behavior next, along with tag-listing parity and snapshot isolation.\n"}}
